      "level": 2,
      "heading": "Overview",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "When you launch a noteworthy app or make an important update to an existing one, you can nominate it for featuring by telling Apple about your plans in App Store Connect. To learn more, see `https://developer.apple.com/app-store/getting-featured` and `https://developer.apple.com/help/app-store-connect/manage-featuring-nominations/nominate-your-app-for-featuring`.",
